@startuml
' Module dependency diagram, simplified for report rendering.

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName "SimSun"
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
left to right direction

title CulCloud 前后端核心模块依赖图

package "前端模块" #FAF5FF {
  [用户工作台\nDashboard / MyFiles] as UserViews
  [文件处理界面\nConvertCenter / PDFStudio] as WorkViews
  [管理端界面\nAnalytics / SystemStatus] as AdminViews
  [统一请求封装\nAPI Client] as ApiClient
}

package "FastAPI 接口模块" #FFF7ED {
  [文件与目录接口\nfiles / folders] as FileRoutes
  [预览与转换接口\npreview / convert] as ConvertRoutes
  [任务与运行接口\ntasks / logs / system] as OpsRoutes
}

package "领域服务模块" #FFF1F2 {
  [对象存储服务\nMinIO Client] as ObjectService
  [转换处理服务\nDocumentConverter] as ConvertService
  [任务日志服务\nTask Tracker / Log Collector] as RuntimeService
}

package "外部运行依赖" #F0FDFA {
  database "MinIO" as MinIO
  database "Redis" as Redis
  [Gotenberg] as Gotenberg
  [Flask Analytics] as Flask
}

UserViews --> ApiClient
WorkViews --> ApiClient
AdminViews --> ApiClient

ApiClient --> FileRoutes : 文件/目录
ApiClient --> ConvertRoutes : 预览/转换
ApiClient --> OpsRoutes : 任务/日志/健康
AdminViews --> Flask : 历史分析 API

FileRoutes --> ObjectService
ConvertRoutes --> ConvertService
ConvertRoutes --> RuntimeService
OpsRoutes --> RuntimeService

ObjectService --> MinIO
ConvertService --> Gotenberg
ConvertService --> MinIO
RuntimeService --> Redis

legend bottom
  依赖方向：调用方 --> 被调用方
  本图只表达模块级依赖，不展开文件级代码清单
endlegend

@enduml
